<title>CANADA: Marshall Minerals to file for share buyback.</title>
<headline>Marshall Minerals to file for share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NIAGARA FALLS, Ontario 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marshall Minerals Corp said it intends to commence a normal course issuer bid to acquire up to 2.5 percent or 300,000 of its outstanding common shares by way of open market purchases through the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Marshall said it expects the bid to commence February 19, 1997 and end February 18, 1998.</p>
<p>There are currently 12,036,089 common shares of Marshall outstanding.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
